5,1,1,talk,Minato,,I want to know how hard the treasurer's job is. I'll check the logged hours and the sign-up records.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,We need a realistic budget. I will look at the ledger of outgoings and the bank statements on renewals.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
