30,2,1,talk,Minato,,The treasurer spends way too much time chasing small payments. It's six hours a month for session fees!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Most of our costs are fixed, like insurance and hall hire. Also, many members struggle to pay all at once.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Minako,,People who didn't join felt a yearly fee was too much. Past tiered systems also caused friction.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,May,,Charging for outings killed the weekday turnout. Some members also feel guilty about paying for things they rarely attend.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"It's exactly as I thought. A tiny group does everything, while some people pay and never show up.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@Ryuji, if people struggle with one payment, maybe smaller ones are better? But the treasurer will suffer.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Minato, that's the dilemma. But we can't ignore that seventy percent of costs happen regardless of attendance.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@May, if the quieter members feel uneasy, maybe a flat fee is actually the problem?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,May,,"@Minako, but the turnout dropped when we added charges. People like knowing it's already paid for.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,We can't keep subsidizing the ghosts with the hard-working few. It's unfair to the nine people on the rota.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Minato,,I just don't want the next treasurer to quit. The mid-year calculations are a nightmare too.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,We need a system that ensures the fixed costs are covered without guessing our income.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Minako,,"We must be careful. If we make it too rigid, we lose the welcoming atmosphere for newcomers.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,May,,"I agree. We need to remove the ""weighing up"" process before coming to a meeting.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"Then we need a system that reflects actual usage, or at least acknowledges the disparity.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
